    <preface>
      <p>Family Law Amendment (Family Violence and Cross-examination of Parties) Act 2018</p>
      <p>No. 159, 2018</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Family Law Act 1975</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Family Law Act 1975	3</p>
      <p>Family Law Amendment (Family Violence and Cross-examination of Parties) Act 2018</p>
      <p>No. 159, 2018</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Family Law Act 1975</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 10 December 2018</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
